  <aisolate:Question contextRef="c-1">What was Julian's last troponin, and which blood thinners is he on?</aisolate:Question>
  <aisolate:Answer contextRef="c-1">Julian Marek's last troponin was 38 ng/L, and he is on the blood thinners 
| drug | dose | frequency |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Apixaban | 5 mg | twice daily |
| Aspirin | 100 mg | once daily |
.</aisolate:Answer>
